[CHOSEN, not recovered] vkd3d-shader 2.1 patch for the BF2 macOS port (LGPL-2.1+, as vkd3d).
vs_1_x frc can only write .y or .xy (it is an expp macro). Emit frc one component
at a time into .y of a fixed-mask result register and move it into place. BF2:
every D3DCOLORtoUBYTE4-style index computation in vs_1_1 (1094 shaders).

diff --git a/libs/vkd3d-shader/hlsl_codegen.c b/libs/vkd3d-shader/hlsl_codegen.c
